== Easter egg
<easter-egg>
#strong[Ouroboros], an additive synthesis oscillator with 6 partials.

Use the chaining cable to link the module to itself.

The first channel sets the fundamental frequency: slider for coarse
tuning, pot for fine-tuning. The #strong[CV] input will track
#strong[V/O].

For the remaining channels, the slider and #strong[CV] input set the
amplitude of the harmonic, and the pot adjusts its frequency ratio.

Output 1 contains all harmonics mixed and enveloped, outputs 2-6 contain
each individual harmonics.

The #strong[GATE] inputs can be used to \"ping\" an individual harmonic.

Finally, the segment type buttons cycle through different waveforms:

- #strong[Green]: sine
- #strong[Orange]: triangle
- #strong[Red]: square
- #strong[Green] blinking: saw
- #strong[Orange] blinking: 25% pulse
- #strong[Red] blinking: 10% pulse
